{"type":"standard","title":"Christine Drazan","displaytitle":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Christine Drazan</span></span>","namespace":{"id":0,"text":""},"wikibase_item":"Q71332580","titles":{"canonical":"Christine_Drazan","normalized":"Christine Drazan","display":"<span lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Christine Drazan</span></span>"},"pageid":62083537,"thumbnail":{"source":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/2c/Christine_Drazan_in_August_2022_%28cropped%29.jpg/330px-Christine_Drazan_in_August_2022_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","width":330,"height":437},"originalimage":{"source":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2c/Christine_Drazan_in_August_2022_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","width":1653,"height":2191},"lang":"en","dir":"ltr","revision":"1369464985","tid":"73f5ce0b-985f-11f1-90c0-97d3c2312eed","timestamp":"2026-08-15T04:11:56Z","description":"American politician (born 1972)","description_source":"local","content_urls":{"desktop":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christine_Drazan","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christine_Drazan?action=history","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christine_Drazan?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Christine_Drazan"},"mobile":{"page":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christine_Drazan","revisions":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Special:History/Christine_Drazan","edit":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Christine_Drazan?action=edit","talk":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Talk:Christine_Drazan"}},"extract":"Christine Renee Drazan is an American politician who serves in the Oregon State Senate from the 26th district as a member of the Republican Party. Prior to her tenure in the state senate she was a member of the Oregon House of Representatives from the 39th and 51st districts. She was minority leader in the state house from 2019 to 2021, and in 2025.","extract_html":"<p><b>Christine Renee Drazan</b> is an American politician who serves in the Oregon State Senate from the 26th district as a member of the Republican Party. Prior to her tenure in the state senate she was a member of the Oregon House of Representatives from the 39th and 51st districts. She was minority leader in the state house from 2019 to 2021, and in 2025.</p>"}